<!--
AI-generated (Claude Code). Start of AI-generated text.

Mix Two: CDJ-style HUD deck window.
  * header bar        hud_header.xml
  * track info        hud_trackinfo.xml
  * waveforms, phase meter row, overview, bottom strip and the side column
                      hud_waves.xml (strip: hud_strip.xml)
  * lower panel       empty slot (not built yet)
The rate column (DeckRate<N>, deck_singletons.xml) sits on the mixer edge.

Variables:
  ChanNum, Group
  Mirror      0 = side column on the right (decks 1, 3),
              1 = side column on the left (decks 2, 4)
  HudHdrL/R, HudIdL/R, HudInfoL/R, HudStatsL/R, HudSideL/R, HudRateL/R
              names of the singletons for each mirrored slot, set per deck
